            "target_entity_instance": "DICE model",
            "target_entity_type": "Source",
            "paragraph": "Before concluding this section, let us note that the DICE model, and therefore also the stochastic DICE model, is highly stylized and spatially aggregated. To overcome this limitation, a regional version of the DICE model, the so-called RICE model [16] has been developed.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
